<title>JAPAN: Japanese net foreign bond buyers in April.</title>
<headline>Japanese net foreign bond buyers in April.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net purchases of foreign bonds by Japanese investors totalled 2.5783 trillion yen in April after net purchases of 393.0 billion yen a month earlier, the Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bonds include beneficiary certificates but exclude all bills.</p>
<p>Net buying of Japanese stocks by foreign investors amounted to 204.9 billion yen in April compared with net purchases of 558.7 billion yen the previous month, the ministry said.  </p>
<p>Details of Japanese and foreigners' investments in billions of yen, were as follows:</p>
<p>JAPANESE INVESTMENT</p>
<p> Foreign stocks: Net	     Foreign bonds: Net</p>
<p> April	+391.5		April	+2,578.3</p>
<p> March	-100.2		March	  +393.0</p>
<p>FOREIGNERS' INVESTMENT</p>
<p> Japanese stocks: Net	    Japanese bonds: Net</p>
<p> April	+204.9		April	  +237.5</p>
<p> March	+558.7		March	  -489.4</p>
<p>Figures are rounded and based on settlements.</p>
</text>
